            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[Notex 0.1.3

Updates, at your pace

- A quiet Update available button appears at the bottom of the sidebar when a new version is ready. Hide the sidebar and the button moves to the toolbar.
- Open the button to review what's new and choose when to install.
- Remind Me Later keeps the button available, even after you reopen Notex. Skip This Version hides it. The button clears after you update.
- Notex checks when it opens and once a day. You can turn automatic checks off in Settings > Updates.
]]></description>
